        "product_summary": "Mesh-panel construction: Open-texture sections at the toe and side sit beneath contrasting stitched overlays for a layered athletic casual look.\n\nLace-up adjustment: Eyelet rows across the instep provide an adjustable fastening, with the actual lace guides visible in the top view.\n\nSculpted sole profile: Raised sidewall details and a patterned bottom give buyers a clear view of the sole layout.\n\nCollar and rear loop: A low-top opening with a textured lining surface and a visible heel pull loop completes the upper profile.\n\nAssortment planning: Military Green and Black are listed in EU39-44. Send colour-size quantities, packing preference and destination for a wholesale quotation.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
